</div>
</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="container ${containerCls}">
    <div class="footer__cols pc-only">
      <div class="footer__brand">
        <span class="logo__name">윤상문고</span>
        <p>교재 BookMarketSwing을 톰캣 웹으로 옮긴 연습용 온라인 서점이에요.<br>실제 결제는 일어나지 않아요.</p>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="쇼핑">
        <h2>쇼핑</h2>
        <a href="${ctx}/books">베스트셀러</a><a href="${ctx}/books?tab=new">신간</a><a href="${ctx}/cart">장바구니</a>
      </nav>
      <nav aria-label="내 계정">
        <h2>내 계정</h2>
        <a href="${ctx}/orders">주문 내역</a><a href="${ctx}/wishlist">찜한 책</a><a href="${ctx}/coupons">쿠폰함</a><a href="${ctx}/mypage">내 정보</a>
      </nav>
      <div>
        <h2>프로젝트</h2>
        <p>웹 프로그래밍 팀 과제<br>Tomcat 10.1 · JSP/Servlet · JDBC<br>도서 검색: 카카오 책 검색 API</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="m-only">윤상문고는 웹 프로그래밍 팀 과제로 만든 연습용 서점이에요. 실제 결제는 일어나지 않아요.</p>
  </div>
</footer>

<div class="sheet" id="menu-sheet" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="menu-title" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="sheet__head">
    <h2 class="t-title1" id="menu-title">
      <c:choose>
        <c:when test="${empty me}">메뉴</c:when>
        <c:otherwise><c:out value="${me.name}" />님</c:otherwise>
      </c:choose>
    </h2>
    <button type="button" class="icon-btn" data-sheet-close aria-label="메뉴 닫기"><ui:icon name="x" /></button>
  </div>
  <nav aria-label="전체 메뉴">
    <a href="${ctx}/books" ${nav == 'books' ? 'aria-current="page"' : ''}><ui:icon name="library-big" />도서</a>
    <a href="${ctx}/cart" ${nav == 'cart' ? 'aria-current="page"' : ''}><ui:icon name="shopping-cart" />장바구니<span class="muted num">${cartCount}권</span></a>
    <a href="${ctx}/orders" ${nav == 'orders' ? 'aria-current="page"' : ''}><ui:icon name="receipt" />주문 내역</a>
    <a href="${ctx}/wishlist" ${nav == 'wishlist' ? 'aria-current="page"' : ''}><ui:icon name="heart" />찜한 책</a>
    <a href="${ctx}/coupons" ${nav == 'coupons' ? 'aria-current="page"' : ''}><ui:icon name="ticket-percent" />쿠폰함</a>
    <a href="${ctx}/mypage" ${nav == 'mypage' ? 'aria-current="page"' : ''}><ui:icon name="user-round" />내 정보</a>
    <c:if test="${me.admin}"><a href="${ctx}/admin" ${nav == 'admin' ? 'aria-current="page"' : ''}><ui:icon name="settings" />관리자</a></c:if>
    <c:choose>
      <c:when test="${empty me}">
        <a href="${ctx}/login"><ui:icon name="log-in" />로그인</a>
      </c:when>
      <c:otherwise>
        <form method="post" action="${ctx}/logout">
          <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="${sessionScope.csrf}">
          <button type="submit"><ui:icon name="log-out" />로그아웃</button>
        </form>
      </c:otherwise>
    </c:choose>
  </nav>
</div>
<div class="sheet-dim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<c:if test="${not empty sessionScope.flash}">
  <div class="toast" id="toast" role="status"><ui:icon name="circle-check" /><span><c:out value="${sessionScope.flash}" /></span></div>
  <c:remove var="flash" scope="session" />
</c:if>

<script src="${ctx}/js/theme.js"></script>
<script src="${ctx}/js/ui.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
